    "sl_custom_faq_r7Q6ht": {
      "type": "sl-custom-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "faq_item_qjMHfp": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How often should I get a facial?",
            "answer": "<p>For optimal results, we recommend facials every 4-6 weeks. This aligns with your skin's natural cell turnover cycle. However, frequency depends on your skin concerns - acne-prone skin may benefit from every 2-3 weeks initially, while maintenance can be every 6-8 weeks. We'll create a schedule that works for your skin and budget.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_PzXEKn": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What's the difference between your facials and spa facials?",
            "answer": "<p>While we provide a relaxing spa experience, our facials are results-focused treatments. We use professional-grade products with active ingredients, perform thorough extractions when needed, and incorporate advanced modalities like LED therapy and chemical peels. Every step is customized to address your specific skin concerns, not just provide temporary relaxation.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_GmWhMf": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Will a facial help with my acne?",
            "answer": "<p>Absolutely! Professional facials are one of the most effective treatments for acne. We perform proper extractions to clear clogged pores, use antibacterial treatments, and apply products that regulate oil production and prevent future breakouts. Combined with the right home care routine, most clients see significant improvement within 2-3 treatments.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_PGh67J": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What should I expect during my first facial?",
            "answer": "<p>Your first visit starts with a consultation and skin analysis. We'll discuss your concerns, current routine, and goals. The facial itself includes cleansing, exfoliation, steam (if appropriate), extractions (if needed), treatment mask, serums, and moisturizer with SPF. You'll be comfortable throughout - we explain each step and adjust pressure and products to your comfort level.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_XkqtLR": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is there downtime after a facial?",
            "answer": "<p>Most facials have no downtime - you'll leave glowing! You may have slight redness for a few hours, especially after extractions. We recommend avoiding heavy makeup for the rest of the day and skipping intense exercise for 24 hours. For treatments with peels or dermaplaning, we'll give you specific aftercare instructions, but you can return to normal activities immediately.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_P6KPXe": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you sell products? Will I be pressured to buy?",
            "answer": "<p>We carry professional skincare products because home care is crucial for maintaining results. However, we NEVER pressure clients to purchase. We'll educate you about what your skin needs and may recommend products, but the choice is always yours. We can also work with products you already own if they're appropriate for your skin.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
